==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|heedstrong}}, equivalent to {{compound|en|head|strong}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|en-us-headstrong.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# [[determined|Determined]] to do as one pleases, and not as others want.
#: ''He was in that '''headstrong''' teenage phase when he felt like he knew everything.''

